	measure TyLePhaSan_TheoSize = ```
			
			VAR SoCongTyPhaSan = CALCULATE(COUNTROWS('FactBankruptcy'), 'FactBankruptcy'[TrangThaiPhaSan] = "failed")
			VAR TongSoCongTy_BoQuaFilter = CALCULATE(COUNTROWS('FactBankruptcy'), REMOVEFILTERS('FactBankruptcy'[TrangThaiPhaSan]))
			RETURN 
			DIVIDE(SoCongTyPhaSan, TongSoCongTy_BoQuaFilter, 0)
			```
